# Design system

Dark theme only. Use Tailwind tokens from `tailwind.config.ts`:

| Token | Value / class |
|-------|----------------|
| Background | `bg-background` (#080808) |
| Cards | `card-surface` or `bg-surface border-border` |
| Accent | `text-accent` / `bg-accent` (#F5A623) |
| Body text | `text-foreground`, `text-muted`, `text-subtle` |

## Typography

- Section labels: `.section-label` (11px, bold, uppercase, amber, 2px tracking)
- Headlines: `font-display` — italic + amber for emphasis phrases
- Body: `font-body` font-light, leading relaxed

## Layout

- Section spacing: `py-section` (100px desktop target)
- Mobile-first: verify 375px and 1440px
- Full-width CTAs on mobile

## Forbidden

Purple, blue, generic fintech gradients, light mode toggle
